cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it. Each release is archived with its
  own version; cite the one you used.
type: dataset
title: "Convert.To.Huh: a measured dataset of what file-format conversions destroy"
abstract: >-
  A CC0 dataset recording, per engine and per exact invocation, what each
  file-format conversion loses, measured against real specimens rather than
  documentation. Each entry carries a loss vector over a closed vocabulary of
  properties, a verification status, the measurement behind it and, where
  available, how often each loss occurred on real files.
authors:
  - name: "Convert.To.Huh contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Stan2032/Convert.To.Huh"
license: CC0-1.0
version: "2026.11.5"
keywords:
  - file formats
  - format conversion
  - digital preservation
  - data loss
  - PRONOM
